WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:02.508
<v><b>Nick:</b></v> Hi there. I’m Nick.

00:00:02.764 --> 00:00:03.550
<v><b>Expert:</b></v> Hi, Nick.

00:00:03.853 --> 00:00:05.384
So what’s your problem?

00:00:06.126 --> 00:00:09.657
<v><b>Nick:</b></v> Well, I’ve been with my girlfriend for three years.

00:00:09.879 --> 00:00:13.352
We have a really great relationship although we’re quite different.

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:15.475
She’s clever and popular,

00:00:15.476 --> 00:00:19.590
and I’m, er, quiet and hard-working.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:24.985
Anyway, now she wants to move to London because she thinks she can get a better job there,

00:00:25.145 --> 00:00:28.315
and she wants me to go to London, too – you know,

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.696
London’s much more exciting than Bolton, where we live now.

00:00:32.020 --> 00:00:35.668
But I have a good job in Bolton and I get a good salary.

00:00:35.918 --> 00:00:39.664
I mean, the idea of moving and having a new life is like a dream, but

00:00:39.787 --> 00:00:41.692
for me that’s what it is – I mean,

00:00:41.717 --> 00:00:44.127
it’s a dream, it isn’t real.

00:00:44.353 --> 00:00:45.810
What should I do?

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:49.062
Should I follow my heart and move to London with her?

00:00:49.265 --> 00:00:54.306
Or should I stay here, where I know I have a good job, but possibly lose my girlfriend?